Mayuri...

1678
00:19:33,104 --> 00:19:33,894
Mayuri!

1679
00:19:35,314 --> 00:19:36,354
Mayuri!

1680
00:20:24,274 --> 00:20:27,234
I'll never forgive you! Ever!

1681
00:20:27,234 --> 00:20:32,534
Okarin, Mayushii is very sad and very embarrassed.

1682
00:20:32,534 --> 00:20:33,914
Jeez!

1683
00:20:33,914 --> 00:20:37,454
Not only did you peep on us in the shower, 
you forgot all the shopping!

1684
00:20:37,454 --> 00:20:39,544
