1686
00:20:41,874 --> 00:20:43,424
Okarin?

1687
00:20:45,754 --> 00:20:46,714
It's Daru-kun!

1688
00:20:47,294 --> 00:20:48,304
What's wrong?

1689
00:20:48,304 --> 00:20:49,504
Why are you here so late?

1690
00:20:51,844 --> 00:20:53,184
I knew it.

1691
00:20:53,844 --> 00:20:55,644
When I accessed it from the outside,

1692
00:20:55,644 --> 00:20:57,724
